{"repositoryId":605199029,"availability":"available","full":"everydaycodings/MimicMania","name":"MimicMania","description":"MimicMania is a web application that allows you to generate speech and clone voices using text-to-speech technology. With MimicMania, you can create custom voices in a variety of languages and use them for a range of applications, from voiceovers to chatbots.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":61,"forks":11,"created":"2023-02-22T16:51:47Z","updated":"2023-02-28T19:12:04Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://mimicmania.streamlit.app","topics":["cloning","hacktoberfest","jspeech","python","streamlit","tacotron","text-to-speech","tts","voice-cloning"],"demo":"https://mega.nz/file/5ShTiARB#aO4ecf518xnBnj1HKx98y4vw4ozQwSRFgKLifxFJO-E","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:52.209Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:52.209Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:52.209Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T00:57:52.209Z","stars":61,"forks":11}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["MiniMania is a web application that provides text-to-speech (TTS) and voice cloning capabilities. The application utilizes deep learning models to generate high-quality speech output in multiple languages, with options to customize the pitch, speed, and volume of the generated audio. MiniMania's TTS engine is built on top of the Tacotron 2 and WaveGlow models, while its voice cloning capabilities are based on the FastSpeech and MelGAN models."],"features":["Easy-to-use interface: MimicMania has a user-friendly interface that allows users to quickly generate speech in their desired language and voice.","Multiple languages: MimicMania supports multiple languages, including English, Spanish, French, and more.","Multiple voices: MimicMania provides a range of voices for each language, giving users a wide variety of options to choose from.","Customizable parameters: Users can adjust the speed, pitch, and volume of the generated speech to fit their specific needs.","Voice cloning: MimicMania's voice cloning technology allows users to clone their own voice, making it easier than ever to create personalized voiceovers."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/everydaycodings/MimicMania/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"52de6616729dc47a93d2b558ae4156c2274244fed116032151bddab0b3fb42db","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:52.324Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:52.324Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"MiniMania is a web application that provides text-to-speech (TTS) and voice cloning capabilities. The application utilizes deep learning models to generate high-quality speech output in multiple languages, with options to customize the pitch, speed, and volume of the generated audio. MiniMania's TTS engine is built on top of the Tacotron 2 and WaveGlow models, while its voice cloning capabilities are based on the FastSpeech and MelGAN models.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/everydaycodings/MimicMania/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"52de6616729dc47a93d2b558ae4156c2274244fed116032151bddab0b3fb42db","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/everydaycodings/MimicMania/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:52.324Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2023-02-28T19:12:04Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/everydaycodings/MimicMania/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:52.324Z","hash":"52de6616729dc47a93d2b558ae4156c2274244fed116032151bddab0b3fb42db","originalBytes":3612,"storedBytes":3612,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["mimicmania","install","command","espeak-ng","everydaycodings","speech","voice","cloning","download","ffmpeg","multiple","run","text-to-speech","their","users","apt-get","clone","engine","execute","languages","python","required","terminal.","tts","various","allows","application","create","demo","espeak","features"